spi: offload: quote the default symbol namespace

Stable commit 889433a2ed5aa ("module: Convert default symbol namespace to string
literal") makes _EXPORT_SYMBOL() use DEFAULT_SYMBOL_NAMESPACE as a string
literal instead of __stringify()ing it. drivers/spi/spi-offload.c exists in
main only through the upstream SPI offload backport, so it still defines the
namespace as a bare identifier and the EXPORT_SYMBOL_NS_GPL() expansions in the
file fail to assemble ("expected string"). Convert it like the other users.

diff --git a/drivers/spi/spi-offload.c b/drivers/spi/spi-offload.c
--- a/drivers/spi/spi-offload.c
+++ b/drivers/spi/spi-offload.c
@@ -14,7 +14,7 @@
  * processor core to offload the work.
  */
 
-#define DEFAULT_SYMBOL_NAMESPACE SPI_OFFLOAD
+#define DEFAULT_SYMBOL_NAMESPACE "SPI_OFFLOAD"
 
 #include <linux/cleanup.h>
 #include <linux/device.h>
